## Scope of this verification

PS-U09 is a docs-only inventory fix, so the application test suite is not required. The gates
exercised are: lockfile/install health, Prettier conformance of the touched docs, the concrete
in-repo claims each finding rests on, and the gitleaks secret gate.

## 1. Lab sync

cmd: powershell -File C:\temp\proxmox-vm\scripts\lab-sync.ps1 -Repo chat
output (tail):
  tarball: 110.2 MB
  ssh.exe : tar: Ignoring unknown extended header keyword 'SCHILY.fflags'
  ... NativeCommandError ...
  Exited with code 1
note: lab-sync.ps1 sets $ErrorActionPreference='Stop', and Windows PowerShell turns the remote
tar stderr warning ("Ignoring unknown extended header keyword 'SCHILY.fflags'") into a
terminating NativeCommandError, so the wrapper reports exit 1 AFTER the tar extraction has
completed. The sync is effective: the branch content is present in /srv/work/chat (proven by the
content checks in section 4). This is a harness quirk, not a repository failure. Raw log:
remediation/PS-U09/lab-sync.log

