interpretation (INV-P2-003): `test-signin.json` IS tracked in the repo at the audited commit
(`git ls-files` lists it), while the stale audit report claimed it was absent; the stale phrasing
now occurs 0 times and the correction is present.
interpretation (INV-P3-002): the webhook service throws when WEBHOOK_ENCRYPTION_KEY is unset
(service.ts:22), yet `grep -l` finds the key in NONE of `.env.example`,
`apps/api/.env.example`, `infra/docker/.env.prod.example`, `infra/docker/.env.devremote.example`
— confirming the templates omit a key that is required for webhook secret encryption. The
canonical env doc now records this.

